  "description": "A thread-safe, lock-free .NET 10 PRNG built on a reduced-round AES-NI counter-mode core. Faster than RandomNumberGenerator (the OS cryptographic RNG) on both single values and bulk fills, with built-in casino-style uniform ranges, weighted selection, and unbiased shuffle. If you find it useful, consider supporting development: https://ko-fi.com/hristostoev",
